{'symbol': 'PSX', 'date': '2022-12-09 11:11:00', 'title': 'PHILLIPS 66 ANNOUNCES 2023 CAPITAL PROGRAM', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PHILLIPS 66 (NYSE: PSX) TODAY ANNOUNCED A 2023 CAPITAL PROGRAM OF $2 BILLION, INCLUDING $865 MILLION FOR SUSTAINING CAPITAL AND $1.1 BILLION FOR GROWTH CAPITAL. APPROXIMATELY 50% OF GROWTH CAPITAL SUPPORTS LOWER-CARBON OPPORTUNITIES. THE CAPITAL PROGRAM IS CONSISTENT WITH THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO MAINTAIN A $2 BILLION ANNUAL BUDGET THROUGH 2024."}